  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.17: footnote rendering and diagnostic-coordinate fixes. #63: the layout/Avalonia live-preview path now renders footnotes as a numbered [n] marker with the bodies collected into a trailing footnotes area, instead of inlining the body text at the reference. #64: PDF footnote markers now render as a smaller, raised superscript that is a clickable internal link to the footnote entry (which links back to the reference), with no stray space before following punctuation. #67: diagnostic ranges (and the adocnet CLI's file:line) are now reported in original-source line numbers rather than post-include-expansion coordinates, and Diagnostic.FilePath names the included file when a diagnostic originates inside one; added ParseResult.ToSourceLine(int). See CHANGELOG.md.",
